                                "sense_id": "88f10b88-4acd-3918-b5a9-6ab1df5fe1f4",
                                "text": "A splunk, like a rock hitting water, brought him to a standstill, straining to hear."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ba0b83af-35d0-453c-b225-18162d8c6f58",
                                "sense_id": "88f10b88-4acd-3918-b5a9-6ab1df5fe1f4",
                                "text": "Splunk! Mid-muse, Darcy was startled by a weird noise — something between a splat and a thunk. Pausing in her apple-picking, she looked around. Splunk! There it was again!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb09f8e8-8999-40ab-a111-7d73040e7f8a",
                                "sense_id": "88f10b88-4acd-3918-b5a9-6ab1df5fe1f4",
                                "text": "Was that the hose? Did they drop it in? Splunk. Something hit the water."
                            }
                        ]
